{"lines": ["A dad photographed his daughter on a marsh. Back from Kodak, a spaceman stood behind her.", "Burgh Marsh, 1964. Firefighter Jim Templeton takes three photos. He swears no one else was there.", "But the middle shot shows a white figure with a dark visor. Police find nothing suspicious.", "Kodak finds no fakery. Its reward for proving a hoax goes unclaimed.", "Then, he says, two men calling themselves Number Nine and Eleven demand to see the spot.", "A rumour ties it to an aborted Australian rocket launch. That film shows only lens flare.", "In 2014, researcher David Clarke offers a simpler answer: his wife Annie, back turned, her blue dress blown out to white.", "Templeton died in 2011, insisting the figure was real.", "So, spaceman, or just Annie? Tell me below."], "words": [["A", 0.0, 0.08], ["dad", 0.08, 0.38], ["photographed", 0.38, 0.98], ["his", 0.98, 1.44], ["daughter", 1.44, 1.76], ["on", 1.76, 2.06], ["a", 2.06, 2.12], ["marsh.", 2.12, 2.4], ["Back", 3.06, 3.16], ["from", 3.16, 3.42], ["Kodak,", 3.42, 3.98], ["a", 4.2, 4.24], ["spaceman", 4.24, 4.76], ["stood", 4.76, 5.02], ["behind", 5.02, 5.38], ["her.", 5.38, 5.72], ["Burgh", 6.26, 6.48], ["Marsh,", 6.48, 6.78], ["1964.", 7.26, 7.9], ["Firefighter", 9.18, 9.82], ["Jim", 9.82, 10.36], ["Templeton", 10.36, 11.08], ["takes", 11.08, 11.36], ["three", 11.36, 11.74], ["photos.", 11.74, 12.32], ["He", 12.78, 12.82], ["swears", 12.82, 13.24], ["no", 13.24, 13.5], ["one", 13.5, 13.7], ["else", 13.7, 13.88], ["was", 13.88, 14.12], ["there.", 14.12, 14.42], ["But", 15.02, 15.06], ["the", 15.06, 15.18], ["middle", 15.18, 15.4], ["shot", 15.4, 15.7], ["shows", 15.7, 16.2], ["a", 16.2, 16.38], ["white", 16.38, 16.6], ["figure", 16.6, 17.04], ["with", 17.04, 17.36], ["a", 17.36, 17.48], ["dark", 17.48, 17.78], ["visor.", 17.78, 18.46], ["Police", 18.88, 19.08], ["find", 19.08, 19.48], ["nothing", 19.48, 19.86], ["suspicious.", 19.86, 20.16], ["Kodak", 21.191, 21.58], ["finds", 21.58, 21.86], ["no", 21.86, 22